menu "Motor Controller Configuration"

    config MOTOR_CTRL_DEFAULT_COUNTS_PER_REV
        int "Default encoder counts per output revolution"
        default 1440
        range 1 1000000
        help
            Total encoder quadrature counts per one full revolution of the shaft
            being measured. For a 4x-decoded quadrature encoder with N pulses/rev,
            set this to N * 4. Example: a 360 CPR encoder gives 1440 counts/rev.
            Overridden per-instance via MotorControllerConfig::counts_per_rev.

    config MOTOR_CTRL_DEFAULT_SAMPLE_TIME_MS
        int "Default PID sample time in milliseconds"
        default 10
        range 1 1000
        help
            Default control loop sample time for both velocity and position PID
            controllers. 10 ms (100 Hz) is typical for DC motor speed control.
            Overridden per-instance via the esp_pid::PidConfig fields inside
            MotorControllerConfig.

endmenu
